    "ff4e216df3146069f9ec728711b51f8dcf2c385c": {
      "message": "feat(director): add the AI video director plugin\n\nA production workspace for AI video: six agent tools keep the project,\nstoryboard, takes and audio under `video/`, an embedded skill carries the\ndirecting method (story structure, shot design, prompt recipe, sound), and a\nread-only right-sidebar board copies paste-ready prompts and shows the review.\n\nThe plugin never generates video or calls a generation API; its product is the\npositive prompt, negative prompt and parameters the user pastes into\nKling/Jimeng/Hailuo, plus the plan and take log around them.\n\n- domain: pure validation, ids, mutations and the deterministic review\n- host: ctx.fs store with optimistic version guards, six tool definitions,\n  the embedded skill and guidance, read-only /dsh-director/api/state\n- client: React board (storyboard, prompts, audio, review) built to client.js\n- repo: packages.mjs, publish workflow, release-gate test, root README,\n  AGENTS.md",
