    "f9b216129a61ff141650f683438720022d5ada97": {
      "message": "fix(ci): name the test files instead of the directory\n\nNode 22's test runner takes file arguments; `node --test scripts/` resolves\nthe directory as a module and fails with \"Cannot find module …/scripts\",\nwhich turned the gate's own step red on the first run. Node 26 accepts the\ndirectory, so the local run hid it.\n\nSpell the glob out in the workflow and in the commands AGENTS.md documents.",
      "author": {
        "name": "litingyes",
        "email": "luz.liting@gmail.com"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "litingyes",
        "email": "luz.liting@gmail.com"
      },
      "committedAt": "2026-11-07T15:09:17+08:00",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
          "status": "M",
          "added": 2,
          "deleted": 1,
          "binary": false
        },
        {
          "path": "AGENTS.md",
          "status": "M",
          "added": 1,
